comments.body:
a mentally healthy person must be able to say the following six things (order not important:)

* i love you;
* thank you;
* i'm sorry;
* I need help;
* this is not good enough;
* flock off.

-------
now, scroll down and repeat the 6 things (order not important.)  most people blank on one item, which supposedly is the thing they have the hardest time expressing.

---------
this is a good small-talk starter when stuck with strangers who have nothing to talk about, e.g., a wedding reception table.
